MANDELBROT v1.0 -- the Mandelbrot set,
explored live at 120 Hz. Drag it, wheel
into it: each new view lands whole in
the tick you ask for it, then sharpens
to the last pixel -- at home or 10^260
deep, every pixel exact or proven by
theorem. Bookmarks that fly, gradients
that cycle. Free forever. -- 73v3
